[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3518815119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3518815119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3518815119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RvNuP","user":{"login":"Joeyrp","id":8443623,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDM2MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8443623?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp","html_url":"https://github.com/Joeyrp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joeyrp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-11T21:30:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T01:25:05Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this in 4.5.1 and 4.6 on windows 11 (I did not test 4.5). I also tested with `dev_build=yes` and that gives an error message instead of crashing.\n\nThe official (4.5.1.stable) build downloaded from the website:\n<img width=\"1141\" height=\"840\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0dbcf159-382f-4fc6-b0f2-a9e88ab5b061\" />\n\n4.5.1 with `dev_build=yes`:\n\n<img width=\"1584\" height=\"482\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07600988-63d3-40c5-90de-317d567683c8\" />\n\n4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13] also crashes and the current master branch - 2cc031f with `dev_build=yes` gives the same error messages as 4.5.1 above.\n\nI've just tested 4.4.1.stable official build as well and it does not crash but it does produce those same error messages as seen with the 4.5.1 with `dev_build=yes`:\n\n<img width=\"1254\" height=\"182\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3954f7ec-3d32-423d-a198-1243d8665570\" />\n\nUPDATE: So it turns out the `dev_build=yes` option doesn't seem to be changing anything actually. If I do my own build with just `scons` as the command (or even `scons production=yes`), I still get the error messages instead of the crashes. I can only seem to reproduce the crash with the official builds downloaded from the website. I guess there's some configuration that the official builds use that's making a difference?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3518815119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3519598344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3519598344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3519598344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RyM8I","user":{"login":"FantasmaGolicon","id":88302389,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzAyMzg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88302389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon","html_url":"https://github.com/FantasmaGolicon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T02:28:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T02:28:37Z","body":"I can repro. Taking a look","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3519598344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521963557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3521963557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3521963557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R7OYl","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T13:31:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T13:31:41Z","body":"Seems the issue is `TileSetScenesCollectionProxyObject` stores its edited `TileSetScenesCollectionSource` as a pointer. The error/crash (depending on the version/build?) happens when on edit its old edited source is already freed and hence the pointer used for the check/disconnecting is no longer valid:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e47fb8b8989fd5589c65c4b0ac980de2e936c041/editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_scenes_collection_source_editor.h#L52\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e47fb8b8989fd5589c65c4b0ac980de2e936c041/editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_scenes_collection_source_editor.cpp#L116-L119\n\nProbably all proxy objects etc. should store their edited resource(s) as `ObjectID` instead, or prevent freeing by storing `Ref<T>`? Not sure. cc @groud","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521963557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522150398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3522150398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3522150398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R77_-","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T14:13:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T14:14:45Z","body":"> Probably all proxy objects etc. should store their edited resource(s) as ObjectID instead, or prevent freeing by storing Ref<T>? Not sure. cc @groud\n\n~Probably a WeakRef/Ref won't work if the proxy object does not extend Resource/RefCounted.  But ObjectID should work indeed.~\n\nMy bad, missread. A Ref/WeakRef shoud work fine with a TileSetScenesCollectionSource.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522150398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3523252409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3523252409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3523252409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SAJC5","user":{"login":"FantasmaGolicon","id":88302389,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzAyMzg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88302389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon","html_url":"https://github.com/FantasmaGolicon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T18:07:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T22:38:59Z","body":"I find it interesting that the crash doesn't occur when the scene collection is deleted using the delete button instead of Undo (i.e. _source_delete_pressed is called). But it could just be timing with the referenced memory not being cleared by the time it is accessed again. I figured I would bring it up anyways in case it rings up any bells.\n\n**Edit**: Okay I now see why. The pointer is kept alive by the methods added for undo\\redo.  It creates Callable objects that are owned by the UndoRedoManager in the undo\\redo stack. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bad1287b62ea09d993fb178bb6b1a61c17ae725e/editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_editor.cpp#L292-L328\n\nThe Callables have a Ref pointer to the newly allocated scene collection pointer. The repro steps cause the redo stack to be cleared (undo, then commit a new action), which will release the pointer. \n\n\nThis issue doesn't happen when deleting the source using the Delete Button because the Undo command now keeps the pointer alive.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bad1287b62ea09d993fb178bb6b1a61c17ae725e/editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_editor.cpp#L274-L290 \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3523252409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529393262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112643#issuecomment-3529393262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112643","id":3529393262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SXkRu","user":{"login":"FantasmaGolicon","id":88302389,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzAyMzg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88302389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon","html_url":"https://github.com/FantasmaGolicon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FantasmaGolicon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T19:30:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T19:30:45Z","body":"#112739 Created this PR based on your suggestions @kleonc and @groud \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529393262/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]